#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.rst:2
msgid "BlinkingReconnection"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres de reconnexion de trajectoires en cas de scintillement."
msgstr "Class containing the settings for reconnecting tracks in the event of scintillation."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:3
msgid "Par principe, on pourrait mettre le minimum de la Distance maximale à 2. Mais, si on veut reconnecter sur deux plans consécutifs avec des distances plus longues que la sélection d'origine, c'est possible."
msgstr "In principle, you could set the minimum value for the maximum distance to 2. However, if you want to reconnect on two consecutive planes with distances longer than those in the original selection, that is possible."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:6
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:7
msgid "**Mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Méthode de déplacement du point (par défaut : `Immobile`)."
msgstr "*Mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Method for moving the point (default: `Stationary`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:8
msgid "**Max Duration** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Durée maximale du scintillement en nombre de plans (par défaut : `1`)."
msgstr "**Max Duration** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Maximum duration of the flickering in frames (default: `1`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.BlinkingReconnection.BlinkingReconnection:10
msgid "**Max Distance** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : Distance maximale en pixel entre deux plans (par défaut : `1.0`) synchronisé avec le paramètre Max Distance du Tracking."
msgstr "**Max Distance** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : Maximum distance in pixels between two planes (default: `1.0`) synchronized with the Tracking's Max Distance setting."

